  "methods": [
    "FDE/CIE records are re-derived from .eh_frame with the repository eh_frame_records parser; body extents and SHA-256 values are pinned for the two owner bodies, the six boundary bodies and the personality shim.",
    "The instruction censuses run over a native objdump linear decode that decode_export requires to be byte-exact and contiguous over each owner extent, cross-checked against an independent text parse; a raw 0xe8-byte census of both bodies backstops the direct-call counts.",
    "LSDA call-site tables are decoded byte-by-byte under both header shapes present in the cluster (0x9b ttype offset and omitted ttype) and compared entry for entry; each blob is also pinned by SHA-256.",
    "Slot bindings come from .rela.dyn addends read at analysis time.",
